[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine the length of each side of the regular octagon, we start by noting that the perimeter of the regular octagon is the same as the perimeter of the regular hexagon. The perimeter of a regular hexagon with side length \( s \) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Perimeter of hexagon} = 6s
