[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -3x^2 + 11x - 7 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The discriminant of this quadratic equation is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
