[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m What is the value of $3\cdot 3 + 3(3 + 3) - 3^3$?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve the expression \(3 \cdot 3 + 3(3 + 3) - 3^3\), we will follow the order of operations, often remembered by the acronym PEMDAS (Parentheses, Exponents, Multiplication and Division (from left to right), Addition and Subtraction (from left to right)).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Evaluate the expression inside the parentheses:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3 + 3 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So the expression now becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3 \cdot 3 + 3 \cdot 6 - 3^3
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Perform the multiplications first:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3 \cdot 3 = 9
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3 \cdot 6 = 18
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So the expression now becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    9 + 18 - 3^3
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Evaluate the exponent:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3^3 = 3 \cdot 3 \cdot 3 = 27
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So the expression now becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    9 + 18 - 27
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Perform the addition and subtraction from left to right:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    9 + 18 = 27
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So the expression now becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    27 - 27
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    27 - 27 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression \(3 \cdot 3 + 3(3 + 3) - 3^3\) is \(\boxed{0}\).<|endoftext|>
