[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To simplify the expression \(\dfrac{18}{17} \cdot \dfrac{13}{24} \cdot \dfrac{68}{39}\), we will multiply the numerators together and the denominators together. The result will be a fraction with the same denominator as the original denominators.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, let's write out the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \dfrac{18}{17} \cdot \dfrac{13}{24} \cdot \dfrac{68}{39}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we will multiply the numerators (18, 13, and 68) together:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 18 \cdot 13 \cdot 68
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To make the multiplication easier, we can break it down:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 18 \cdot 13 = 234
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 234 \cdot 68
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To multiply these two numbers, we can break it down further:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 234 \cdot 68 = 234 \cdot (70 - 2) = 234 \cdot 70 - 2 \cdot 234
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 234 \cdot 70 = 16780
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2 \cdot 234 = 468
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 16780 - 468 = 16312
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the expression now looks like:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \dfrac{16312}{17} \cdot \dfrac{1}{24} \cdot \dfrac{1}{39}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
