[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we simplify the fraction by dividing both the numerator and the denominator by their greatest common divisor (GCD). The GCD of 16312 and 15432 is 12.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
