[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Fourth Trip:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    You eat half of the remaining pizza.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{1}{2} \times \frac{1}{8} = \frac{1}{16}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    The remaining pizza is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{1}{8} - \frac{1}{16} = \frac{2}{16} - \frac{1}{16} = \frac{1}{16}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. **Fifth Trip:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    You eat half of the remaining pizza.
