[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{1}{16} - \frac{1}{32} = \frac{2}{32} - \frac{1}{32} = \frac{1}{32}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m After five trips, you have eaten half of the pizza. Therefore, the fractional part of the pizza you have eaten is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{\frac{1}{32}}
