[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m If the system of equations  \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4x-3y&=2a,\\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2x+y&=3a,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \end{align*}has a solution $(x,y)$ when $x=3$, compute $a$.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve the system of equations and find \(a\), we start with the given equations:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4x - 3y = 2a \quad \text{(Equation 1)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2x + y = 3a \quad \text{(Equation 2)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since we know \(x = 3\), we can substitute \(x = 3\) into both equations to eliminate \(x\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Substituting \(x = 3\) into Equation 1:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4(3) - 3y = 2a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 12 - 3y = 2a \quad \text{(Equation 3)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Substituting \(x = 3\) into Equation 2:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2(3) + y = 3a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6 + y = 3a \quad \text{(Equation 4)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now we have the system:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 12 - 3y = 2a \quad \text{(Equation 3)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6 + y = 3a \quad \text{(Equation 4)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To eliminate \(y\), we can manipulate these equations. First, multiply Equation 4 by 3:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3(6 + y) = 3(3a)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 18 + 3y = 9a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 12 - 3y = 2a \quad \text{(Equation 3)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 18 + 3y = 9a \quad \text{(Equation 5)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Subtract Equation 3 from Equation 5:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (18 + 3y) - (12 - 3y) = 9a - 2a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 18 + 3y - 12 + 3y = 7a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2y + 6 = 7a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2y + 6 = 7a \quad \text{(Equation 6)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From Equation 3, solve for \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 12 - 3y = 2a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3y = 12 - 2a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m y = \frac{12 - 2a}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now substitute \(y = \frac{12 - 2a}{3}\) back into Equation 6:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2\left(\frac{12 - 2a}{3}\right) + 6 = 7a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{24 - 4a}{3} + 6 = 7a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{24 - 4a + 18}{3} = 7a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{42 - 4a}{3} = 7a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 42 - 4a = 21a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 42 = 25a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
