[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(2998^2) = f(5000^2) = f(1000^2) = f(10000000), \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m and
