[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ \sqrt{f(10000000) + 2} = \sqrt{f(10000000) + 2}, \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m which implies:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(10000000) = f(5000000). \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \( f(1) = \sqrt{f(5^2) + 2} \), we have:
