[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(10000000) = f(5000000). \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Hence, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(10000000) = 1000. \]
