[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Notice that the decimal repeats every 6 digits. To identify the 125th digit, we need to determine the position of the digit 125 within the repeating block. We do this by finding the remainder when 125 is divided by 6:
