[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To express the given quantity \(\sqrt{45} - 2\sqrt{5} + \frac{\sqrt{360}}{\sqrt{2}}\) in the form \(\sqrt{N}\), we will simplify each term step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, simplify \(\sqrt{360}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{360} = \sqrt{36 \times 10} = \sqrt{36} \times \sqrt{10} = 6\sqrt{10}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, simplify \(\frac{\sqrt{360}}{\sqrt{2}}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{\sqrt{360}}{\sqrt{2}} = \frac{6\sqrt{10}}{\sqrt{2}} = 6 \cdot \frac{\sqrt{10}}{\sqrt{2}} = 6 \sqrt{\frac{10}{2}} = 6 \sqrt{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, substitute these simplified terms back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{45} - 2\sqrt{5} + 6 \sqrt{5} = \sqrt{45} + 4\sqrt{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We recognize that \(\sqrt{45}\) can be expressed as \(\sqrt{9 \times 5} = \sqrt{9} \times \sqrt{5} = 3\sqrt{5}\), so we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{45} = \sqrt{9 \times 5} = \sqrt{9} \times \sqrt{5} = 3\sqrt{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3\sqrt{5} + 4\sqrt{5} = 7\sqrt{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, \(N = 5\), and we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
