[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine the smallest positive integer \( n \) such that \(\frac{n}{2010}\) is a terminating decimal, we need to understand when a fraction \( \frac{p}{q} \) is a terminating decimal. A fraction \(\frac{p}{q}\) is a terminating decimal if and only if the denominator \( q \) (after simplifying the fraction) has no prime factors other than 2 and 5.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, note that 2010 can be factored as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2010 = 2 \times 3 \times 5 \times 67
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m For \(\frac{n}{2010}\) to be a terminating decimal, the prime factorization of \( n \) must not include any prime factors other than 2 and 5. Therefore, \( n \) must be a multiple of 2010.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we find the smallest \( n \) that is a multiple of 2010. We start with the smallest multiples of 2010:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2010 \times 1 = 2010
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2010 \times 2 = 4020
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2010 \times 3 = 6030
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2010 \times 4 = 8040
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2010 \times 5 = 10050
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We see that we are not exceeding 2010, so the smallest multiple is 10050.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the smallest positive integer \( n \) such that \(\frac{n}{2010}\) is a terminating decimal is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{10050}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
