[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the value of \(\sqrt{3! \cdot 3!}\) expressed as a positive integer, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Calculate \(3!\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3! = 3 \times 2 \times 1 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Substitute \(3!\) into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3! \cdot 3! = 6 \cdot 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Multiply the results:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    6 \cdot 6 = 36
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. Now, we need to find the square root of 36:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \sqrt{36} = 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the value of \(\sqrt{3! \cdot 3!}\) expressed as a positive integer is:
