[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - We know that the probability of rain \(P(R)\) is \(\frac{1}{11}\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The probability of not rain \(P(\bar{R})\) is the complement of the probability of rain, which can be calculated using the formula:
