[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the value of \(\sqrt{104\sqrt6 + 468\sqrt{10} + 144\sqrt{15} + 2006}\), we start by identifying possible values for \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\). These values will help in reducing the expression under the square root to a smaller, more manageable form.
