[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Combining these, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 104\sqrt{6} + 468\sqrt{10} + 144\sqrt{15} + 2006 = 4 \cdot 26\sqrt{6} + 12 \cdot 3\sqrt{10} + 4 \cdot 3 \sqrt{15} + 4 \cdot 2 \sqrt{10} + 11 \sqrt{10} + 2 \sqrt{15} + 2 \sqrt{15} + 15 \sqrt{15} + 75
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
