[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Jim fills 3 bags with thermoses, each of which holds 24 thermoses at 8 cups each. If it takes him 2 hours to make one thermos, calculate the total time taken to fill all the thermoses. To determine the total time taken to fill all the thermoses, we need to follow these steps:
