[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. We need to find the value of \( u \). Since the ratio of \( \overrightarrow{AP} \) to \( \overrightarrow{AB} \) is \( \pm\frac{7}{2} \), we can assume \( t \) to be positive, as we do in this problem.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Using the section formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
