[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m a^2 - b^2 = (a - b)(a + b)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m In our case, we can rewrite \(99^2\) as \(100^2 - (10^2)\). This allows us to apply the difference of squares formula directly.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Identify \(a\) and \(b\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    a = 100 \quad \text{and} \quad b = 10
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Apply the difference of squares formula:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    99^2 = (100^2 - 10^2)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Now, calculate \(100^2\) and \(10^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    10^2 = 100 \quad \text{and} \quad 9^2 = 81
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. Substitute these values back into the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    99^2 = (100 - 81)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. Perform the subtraction:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    100 - 81 = 19
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. Multiply the result by \(99\) to get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    99^2 \times 99 = 19 \times 99
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 7. Multiply 19 by 99:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    19 \times 99 = 19 \times (100 - 1) = 19 \times 100 - 19 \times 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 8. Calculate each term:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    19 \times 100 = 1900
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    19 \times 1 = 19
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 9. Subtract the second term:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    1900 - 19 = 1881
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{1881}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
