[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, substitute back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[99 \times 99 = (90 + 9) \times (90 + 9).\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can use the distributive property (also known as the FOIL method for binomials):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[(90 + 9) \times (90 + 9) = (90 + 9) \times (90 + 9) = 90 \times 90 + 90 \times 9 + 9 \times 90 + 9 \times 9.\]
