[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The simplified polynomial is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ -2x^4 - 5x^3 - 3x^2 + 10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The leading term is \(-2x^4\), and the coefficient of this term is \(-2\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
