[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve this problem, we need to determine how many rectangles of area 3 square units can be formed using only the line segments of the grid as the sides of the rectangles. The grid is a 6x6 grid of unit squares, so the length and width of each rectangle will be at most 6 units.
