[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Add the coefficients of the like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The coefficient of \(w\) is \(2+4+6+8+10+12\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Calculate the sum:
