[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the solutions to the first equation are \( x = \frac{1}{8} \) and \( x = -1 \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, consider the equation \( 24x^2 + 53x - 7 = 0 \). We will use the quadratic formula \( x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a} \), where \( a = 24 \), \( b = 53 \), and \( c = -7 \).
