[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The common chord of two parabolas passing through the focus and having focal points on other axes can be either a segment of a line or a circle depending on their configurations.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given that the directrix of the parabola coincides with the other axes, we interpret this as one of the chords being along the y-axis and the other along the x-axis.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Length of the Chromatic Segment:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Plugging in \(y = -28\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c_x^2 - c_y^2 = 105
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    where \(|c_x| = a\) and \(|c_y| = d\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c_x^2 = a^2 + d^2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c_y^2 = a^2 + d^2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Hence,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \text{Length of the Chromatic Segment} = 2 \times \sqrt{c_y^2 - c_x^2}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Length of the Vocal Chord:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Plugging in \(y = -28\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c_y^2 - c_x^2 = 74
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    where \(|c_x| = a\) and \(|c_y| = d\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c_y^2 = a^2 + d^2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c_x^2 = a^2 + d^2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Hence,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \text{Length of the Vocal Chord} = 2 \times \sqrt{(a^2 + d^2) - (a^2 + d^2)} = 2 \times \sqrt{74}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Adding these two results together, the length of the common chord is,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{2 \times \sqrt{74}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
