[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m However, direct rationalization is more practical here. Simplify by rationalizing \(104\sqrt{6} + 2006\) directly to find integers.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's evaluate:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
