[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, substitute these values back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -8 + 4 - 2 + 2 + 4 + 2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. Simplify the expression step by step:
