[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    11
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Now the expression is simplified to:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3! \div 2
