[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Then:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ a \cdot b = 4 \cdot 6 = 24 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m and:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ a^b + b^a = 4^6 + 6^4 = 4096 + 1296 = 5392 \neq 24 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m It seems we need to re-evaluate our approach. Let's try another pair:
