[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. If \( a = 3 \) and \( b = 6 \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ a \cdot b = 3 \cdot 6 = 18 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This does not work because \( 3^3 + 6^6 = 27 + 46656 = 46683 \neq 18 \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Finally, we find that the correct values are:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ a = \frac{3}{2} \quad \text{and} \quad b = \frac{6}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Then:
