[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m And:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ a^b + b^a = \left(\frac{3}{2}\right)^6 + \left(\frac{6}{2}\right)^3 = \left(\frac{9}{4}\right) + \left(\frac{18}{4}\right) = \frac{27}{4} = 6.75 \neq 9 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The correct values are:
