[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m And:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ a^b + b^a = \left(\frac{5}{2}\right)^6 + \left(\frac{12}{2}\right)^3 = \left(\frac{15625}{64}\right) + \left(\frac{1728}{8}\right) = \frac{15625}{64} + \frac{29115}{64} = \frac{44740}{64} = 70 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
