[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We are given the parametric equations:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (x, y) = \left( \frac{t + 1}{t}, \frac{t - 1}{t} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the type of curve that these parametric coordinates represent, we can eliminate \(t\) from the parametric equations.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Start with the parametric equations:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    x = \frac{t + 1}{t}, \quad y = \frac{t - 1}{t}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Solve for \(t\) in terms of \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    x = \frac{t + 1}{t} \implies x t = t + 1 \implies x t - t = x + 1 \implies t (x - 1) = x + 1 \implies t = \frac{x + 1}{x - 1}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Substitute this expression for \(t\) into the parametric equation for \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    y = \frac{\left(\frac{x + 1}{x - 1}\right) - 1}{\frac{x + 1}{x - 1}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. Simplify the expression for \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    y = \frac{\frac{x + 1 - (x - 1)}{x - 1}}{\frac{x + 1}{x - 1}} = \frac{\frac{x + 1 - x + 1}{x - 1}}{\frac{x + 1}{x - 1}} = \frac{\frac{2}{x - 1}}{\frac{x + 1}{x - 1}} = \frac{2}{x + 1}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m y = \frac{2}{x + 1}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This is the equation of a hyperbola. Therefore, the answer is \(\boxed{E}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{(A)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Extracted Answer]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m E
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
