[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (ii) $f \left( \frac{1}{x + y} \right) = f \left( \frac{1}{x} \right) + f \left( \frac{1}{y} \right)$ for all $x,$ $y \in S$ such that $x + y \in S,$ and
