[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Matrix multiplication**:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \mathbf{D} \mathbf{R} = \begin{pmatrix} k & 0 \\ 0 & k \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} \cos \theta & -\sin \theta \\ \sin \theta & \cos \theta \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Performing the matrix multiplication:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \mathbf{D} \mathbf{R} = \begin{pmatrix} k \cos \theta & -k \sin \theta \\ k \sin \theta & k \cos \theta \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Given matrix equality**:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \mathbf{D} \mathbf{R} = \begin{pmatrix} -7 & 1 \\ -1 & -7 \end{pmatrix}
