[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve the expression \(\sqrt{36+64} - \sqrt{25-16}\), we will break it down into smaller steps and simplify each part.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, let's simplify the expression inside the first square root:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{36+64}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Calculating the sum inside the square root:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 36 + 64 = 100
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{100}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The square root of 100 is 10:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{100} = 10
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, let's simplify the expression inside the second square root:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{25-16}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Calculating the difference inside the square root:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 25 - 16 = 9
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{9}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The square root of 9 is 3:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{9} = 3
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we can substitute these simplified values back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sqrt{100} - \sqrt{25-16} = 10 - 3 = 7
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{7}
