[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \(k\) is the number of terms, the number of terms in the sequence is \(35\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the number of terms of the arithmetic sequence that appear before the number \(-17\) appears is \(\boxed{35}\).<|endoftext|>
