[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ x = 600 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Finally, we should verify the result by substituting \( x = 600 \) back into the original equation to ensure it satisfies the condition that the result is 50 more than if the number had been divided by 4.
