[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Calculate the number of boys in the school.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Find two-thirds of the number of girls and one-half of the number of boys.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. Subtract the number of boys from the sum of the number of girls and boys to find the number of girls attending the picnic.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's start with the first step:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
