[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Condition 2:** \( m \) is also between 30 and 80 and leaves a remainder of 2 when divided by 8, i.e., \( 30 \leq m < 80 \) and \( m \equiv 2 \pmod{8} \).
