[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, let's try \(x = -5\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ x^2 - 2x + 2 = (-5)^2 - 2(-5) + 2 = 25 + 10 + 2 = 37 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ -x^2 + 6x - 2 = -((-5)^2) + 6(-5) - 2 = -25 - 30 - 2 = -57 \]
