[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Evaluate \( f(x) \) at \( x = -3 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    f(x) = \frac{x^2 + 2x + 3}{x}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Substitute \( x = -3 \) into the function:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    f(-3) = \frac{(-3)^2 + 2(-3) + 3}{-3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Simplify the expression inside the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    f(-3) = \frac{9 - 6 + 3}{-3} = \frac{6}{-3} = -2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So, \( f(-3) = -2 \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Evaluate \( g(f(x)) \) using the result from step 1:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    g(f(x)) = g(-2)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Substitute \( x = -2 \) into the function \( g(x) \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    g(-2) = (-2)^3 + 2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Simplify the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    g(-2) = -8 + 2 = -6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So, \( g(-2) = -6 \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
