[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Calculate the Sum:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    The sum of the first 1003 integers is half of the sum of an arithmetic series. The sum of the first 1003 integers is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
