[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Since there are 1003 groups, the total sum is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    1003 \cdot 2016018 = 2021128694.
