[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. \(a_2 = 3\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. To find \(a_3\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    a_3 = a_2 - a_1 = 3 - 1 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. To find \(a_4\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
