[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 7. To find \(a_7\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    a_7 = a_6 - a_5 = -2 - (-3) = -2 + 3 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the value of \(a_7\) is \(\boxed{1}\).
