[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ r = \sqrt{x^2 + y^2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ \theta = \arctan\left(\frac{y}{x}\right) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m For the point \((-4, 0)\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Calculate \( r \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ r = \sqrt{(-4)^2 + 0^2} = \sqrt{16} = 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Calculate \( \theta \):
