[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The numerical value of \( a + b \) is approximately \( 38.7838893274971 \), which confirms our earlier calculations.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
