[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the area of the triangle with vertices \((6,5,3)\), \((3,3,1)\), and \((15,11,9)\), we can use the formula for the area of a triangle in 3D space, which is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{6} \left\| \vec{AB} \times \vec{AC} \right\|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m where \(\vec{AB}\) and \(\vec{AC}\) are vectors from vertex \(A\) to vertices \(B\) and \(C\), respectively.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, we identify the vertices in sorted order:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (A) = (6, 5, 3), \quad (B) = (3, 3, 1), \quad (C) = (15, 11, 9)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The vectors \(\vec{AB}\) and \(\vec{AC}\) are:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \vec{AB} = B - A = (3, 3, 1) - (6, 5, 3) = (-3, -2, -2)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \vec{AC} = C - A = (15, 11, 9) - (6, 5, 3) = (9, 6, 6)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we find the cross product \(\vec{AB} \times \vec{AC}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \vec{AB} \times \vec{AC} = \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -3 & -2 & -2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 9 & 6 & 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Expanding this determinant, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \vec{AB} \times \vec{AC} = \mathbf{i} \left( (-2)(6) - (-2)(6) \right) - \mathbf{j} \left( (-3)(6) - (-2)(9) \right) + \mathbf{k} \left( (-3)(6) - (-2)(9) \right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m = \mathbf{i} ( -12 + 12 ) - \mathbf{j} ( -18 + 18 ) + \mathbf{k} ( -18 + 18 )
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m = \mathbf{i} ( 0 ) - \mathbf{j} ( 0 ) + \mathbf{k} ( 0 )
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m = (0, 0, 0)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
