[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the ratio of \( AC \) to \( BD \), we start by using the information given about the lengths of the segments on the line \(\overline{AB}\), \(\overline{BC}\), \(\overline{AD}\), and \(\overline{CD}\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
