[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given that the quadratic terms do not match the right-hand side, we need to recheck the problem constraints and possible simplifications. However, if we assume the problem is correctly set up and there is no misinterpretation, we should recheck the coefficients of the matching terms:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Re-evaluating the terms carefully:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2x^4 + ( - 5 - 6 )x^3 + ( 7 - 3(-5) )x^2 + ( 4(-5) + 28 )x + 28
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
