[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine the number of distinct three-digit numbers that can be formed using the digits \(1, 2, 3, 4\) without repeating any digit in a three-digit number, we need to consider the constraints on each digit place.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
