[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the product matrix \( C \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ C = \begin{pmatrix} 16 & -4 \\ 37 & -13 \end{pmatrix} \]
