[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the expression now looks like this:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{4 \times 2^{20}}{2^{17}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we divide the entire expression by 2^17. We can use the property of exponents \(\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
