[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given $a \neq 0,$ solve for $x$ in
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} x + a & x  & x \\ x & x + a & x \\ x & x & x + a \end{vmatrix} = 0.\]Give your answer in terms of $a.$
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve the given determinant equation, we will use the formula for the determinant of a 3x3 matrix. The determinant of a matrix 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m a & b & c \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m d & e & f \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m g & h & i
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m is given by 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m a(ei - fh) - b(di - fg) + c(dh - eg).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Here, our matrix is 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m x + a & x & x \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m x & x + a & x \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m x & x & x + a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \end{vmatrix}.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's apply the formula to this determinant. We need to calculate each of the 2x2 determinants:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. \((x + a)\begin{vmatrix} x & x \\ x & x + a \end{vmatrix} - x \begin{vmatrix} x & x \\ x & x + a \end{vmatrix} + x \begin{vmatrix} x & x \\ x & x + a \end{vmatrix}\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, calculate each of the 2x2 determinants:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} x & x \\ x & x + a \end{vmatrix} = x(x + a) - x^2 = x^2 + ax - x^2 = ax,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} x & x \\ x & x + a \end{vmatrix} = x(x + a) - x \cdot x = x^2 + ax - x^2 = ax,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} x & x \\ x & x + a \end{vmatrix} = x(x + a) - x \cdot x = x^2 + ax - x^2 = ax.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Substitute these back into the original determinant formula:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (x + a)(ax) - x(ax) + x(ax) = x(ax + a^2) - x(ax) + x(ax) = x(ax) + x(ax^2) - x(ax) + x(ax) = x(ax + ax^2) = x^2(a + ax).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We need this determinant to be equal to 0:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m x^2(a + ax) = 0.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \(a \neq 0\), we can divide both sides by \(x^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m a + ax = 0.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Rearrange to solve for \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ax = -a \implies x = -1.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the solution is
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{-1}.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -\frac{a}{3}
