[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can choose \(b = 1\) and \(c = 0\), and verify that the areas \(32a + 12b + 48c = 32(1) + 12(1) + 48(0) = 32 + 12 = 44\) and \(2a + 3b + 3c = 2(1) + 3(1) + 3(0) = 2 + 3 = 5\), which satisfies the equation \(2a + 3b + 3c = 1\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the dimensions of the box are \(1\), \(1\), and \(0\), and the volume is:
