[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To evaluate the expression $\frac{3 + x(3 + x) - 3^2}{x - 3 + x^2}$ for \(x = -2\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Substitute \(x = -2\) into the expression.
