[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Total lollipops eaten in five days: \( 100 \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The number of lollipops eaten on each day forms an arithmetic sequence where the first term \( a_1 \) is 6 (lollipops eaten on the first day), and the common difference \( d \) is 6.
