[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve the problem, we need to determine the coordinates of the final image of point \( B \) after translating it down 2 units and right 3 units. We will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Identify the initial coordinates of point \( B \):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
