[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Translate point \( B \) down 2 units:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Subtracting 2 from the y-coordinate:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    B' = (6, 5 - 2) = (6, 3)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
