[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (x, y, z), (y', x'), (y', z'), (z', x'), (z + y) \rightarrow
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let the new coordinates (y') be \(y\). Then, the transformation is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
