[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Number of pairs of pants:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - User has 4 pairs of pants.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Number of possible outfits:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Each outfit can be characterized by combining one shirt and one pair of pants.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The total number of possible outfits is the product of the number of shirts and the number of pairs of pants:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
