[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To evaluate the expression \(3x^2 + 5x - 1\) at \(x = 7\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Substitute \(x = 7\) into the expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3(7)^2 + 5(7) - 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Calculate \(7^2\):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    7^2 = 49
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Multiply \(3\) by \(49\):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    3 \times 49 = 147
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Calculate \(5 \times 7\):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    5 \times 7 = 35
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Substitute these values back into the expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    147 + 35 - 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. **Add \(147\) and \(35\):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    147 + 35 = 182
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 7. **Subtract \(1\) from \(182\):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    182 - 1 = 181
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression \(3x^2 + 5x - 1\) when \(x = 7\) is \(\boxed{181}\).<|endoftext|>
