[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The adjacent sides of the decagon shown meet at right angles.  What is its perimeter?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m unitsize(1 cm);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pair[] A;
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[1] = (0,0);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[2] = (4,0);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[3] = (4,0.5);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[4] = (3,0.5);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[5] = (3,2.5);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[6] = (2.3,2.5);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[7] = (2.3,3.5);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[8] = (1,3.5);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[9] = (1,2.7);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A[10] = (0,2.7);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
