[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Next, consider the next smallest prime number: 3**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    367 \div 3 = 122.333333 \quad (\text{not an integer, so 3 is not a factor})
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Check divisibility by 5:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
