[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine the number of possible 9-digit zip codes, where each digit can be any number from 0 through 9, we need to consider that each digit has 10 possible values (0 through 9).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. The first digit (which cannot be zero) has 9 possible choices (1 through 9, but not 0).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Each of the remaining 8 digits has 10 possible choices (0 through 9).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the total number of possible 9-digit zip codes is calculated by multiplying the number of choices for each digit:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 9 \text{ choices for the first digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the second digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the third digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the fourth digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the fifth digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the sixth digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the seventh digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the eighth digit} \times 10 \text{ choices for the ninth digit}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This can be written more compactly as:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 9 \times 10^8
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Calculating the value:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 9 \times 10^8 = 9 \times 1,000,000,000 = 9,000,000,000
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the number of possible 9-digit zip codes is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{9000000000}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
