[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now we continue to compute \(\mathbf{A}^4\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \mathbf{A}^4 = \begin{pmatrix} 15 & 25 \\ -9 & -15 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 298125 & 434875 \\ 121537.5 & 239187.5 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 565647.5 & 9773375 \\ -645962.5 & 2044718.75 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We observe a pattern in the form of \(\mathbf{A}^n\). Let's hypothesize that:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \mathbf{A}^n = \begin{pmatrix} 2^n - 2^n \cdot (n-1) & (n-1)(2^n + 2 \cdot (-1)^{n+1} + (-1)^n) \\ (-n)^2 (2^n - 2^n + 1) & (n-1)(-1 + (-1)^{n+1}) \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 2^n + 2^n (n-1) & n(2^n + 2 \cdot (-1)^{n+1} + (-1)^n) \\ 2(2^n - 1) & (n-1)(-1 + (-1)^{n+1}) \end{pmatrix}
