[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can see that each term in the series is of the form \(\mathbf{I} + 2 \mathbf{A} + 3 \mathbf{A}^2 + 4 \mathbf{A}^3 + \dotsb\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{\begin{pmatrix} 2 + 2(2 + 2(2 + 2 \cdot (-1)^{n+1} + (-1)^n) + (-1)^{n+2}) & n+1(2 + 2 \cdot (-1)^{n+2} + (-1)^{n+1}) \\ 2(2 + 1) & (n+1)(-1 + (-1)^{n+2}) \end{pmatrix}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
