[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Malcolm can run a race at a speed of 6 minutes per mile, while Joshua runs at 8 minutes per mile. In a 10-mile race, how many minutes after Malcolm crosses the finish line will Joshua cross the finish line if they start the race together?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve this problem, we need to determine how long it will take for Malcolm and Joshua to finish the 10-mile race and then find the difference in their finish times.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step 1: Calculate Malcolm's total time
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Malcolm runs at a speed of 6 minutes per mile. For a 10-mile race:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Time for Malcolm} = 6 \text{ minutes per mile} \times 10 \text{ miles} = 60 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step 2: Calculate Joshua's total time
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Joshua runs at a speed of 8 minutes per mile. For a 10-mile race:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Time for Joshua} = 8 \text{ minutes per mile} \times 10 \text{ miles} = 80 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step 3: Find the difference in their finish times
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find out how many minutes after Malcolm crosses the finish line Joshua will cross the finish line, we subtract Malcolm's time from Joshua's time:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Difference in time} = 80 \text{ minutes} - 60 \text{ minutes} = 20 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, Joshua will cross the finish line \(\boxed{20}\) minutes after Malcolm.<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
