[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To evaluate \(\lceil 8.8 \rceil + \lceil -8.8 \rceil\), we need to understand the definition of the ceiling function. The ceiling function, denoted by \(\lceil x \rceil\), returns the smallest integer greater than or equal to \(x\).
