[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, let's evaluate \(\lceil -8.8 \rceil\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m - The integer part of -8.8 is -9. Therefore, \(\lceil -8.8 \rceil = -9\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
