[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      - \(\{P, R\}: 2\) letters (4 letters)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      The maximum number of letters added to each new set is the minimum of the maximum letters that can be added to each of the new sets:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
