[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. **Calculate the total number of additional license plates:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Each original set gets \(11.25 - 8 = 3.25\) letters.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Each new set gets \(8\) letters.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
