[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find \(\cos 5\theta\) given that \(\cos \theta = \frac{1}{3}\), we will use multiple-angle formulas for cosine. The angle \(5\theta\) can be expressed as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5\theta = \theta + 2\theta + \theta + \theta + \ldots + \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This corresponds to the sum of an arithmetic sequence:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5\theta = \theta (1 + 2 + 3 + \ldots + 2) + 3\theta = \theta \cdot 2 \cdot \frac{2 \cdot 3}{2} + 3\theta = 3\theta (1 + 2 + 3)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5\theta = 3\theta \cdot 6 = 18\theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This means:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 5\theta = \cos (18\theta)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we use the double-angle and sum-to-product identities:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. \(\cos 5\theta = \cos (2\theta + 3\theta) = \cos 2\theta \cos 3\theta - \sin 2\theta \sin 3\theta\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. We need to find \(\cos 2\theta\) and \(\sin 2\theta\). Using the double-angle identities:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 2\theta = \cos 4\theta - 8\cos^3 \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 2\theta = 2\sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Substituting \(\cos \theta = \frac{1}{3}\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 2\theta = \cos 4\theta - 8 \left(\frac{1}{3}\right)^3 = \cos 4\theta - \frac{8}{27}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 2\theta = 2 \sin \theta \left(\frac{1}{3}\right) = \frac{2}{3} \sin \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. Using the double-angle identity for sine:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 2\theta = 2 \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2 \left(\frac{1}{3}\right) \cos \theta = \frac{2}{3} \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos \theta \cos 2\theta = \frac{1}{3} \left(\cos 4\theta - \frac{8}{27}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. Using the double-angle identity for cosine:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 4\theta = 2 \cos^2 2\theta - 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 2\theta \cos 4\theta - \sin 2\theta \sin 4\theta = \left(\cos 4\theta - \frac{8}{27}\right) \cos 2\theta - \frac{2}{3} \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m = \frac{1}{3} \left(\cos 4\theta - \frac{8}{27}\right) \cos 2\theta - \frac{2}{3} \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m = \frac{1}{3} \left(\cos 4\theta - \frac{8}{27}\right) \left(\frac{\cos 4\theta - \cos 2\theta + \sin 2\theta}{2}\right) - \frac{2}{3} \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m = \frac{1}{3} \cos 4\theta (\cos 4\theta - \cos 2\theta + \sin 2\theta) - \frac{2}{3} \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m = \cos 4\theta \cos 4\theta - \frac{1}{3} \cos 4\theta \cos 2\theta + \frac{1}{3} \cos 2\theta \sin 2\theta - \frac{2}{3} \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. Simplifying further, we find:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 2\theta = 2 \cdot 2 \cdot \frac{1}{3} \cdot \frac{1}{3} = \frac{4 \cdot 1}{27} = \frac{4}{27}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 2\theta = \frac{2}{3} \left(\frac{1}{3}\right) = \frac{2}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 7. Finally, substituting back:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 5\theta = \cos (18\theta) = \cos 4\theta - \sin^2 2\theta = 2 \cos 4\theta - \sin^2 2\theta
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 4\theta = 2 \left(2 \cdot \frac{1}{3}\right)^2 - 1 = 2 \left(\frac{4}{9}\right) - 1 = \frac{8}{9} - 1 = -\frac{1}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \cos 5\theta = 2 \left(-\frac{1}{9}\right) - \left(\frac{2}{9}\right)^2 = -\frac{2}{9} - \frac{4}{81} = -\frac{27}{81} - \frac{4}{81} = -\frac{31}{81}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the value of \(\cos 5\theta\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{-\frac{31}{81}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
