[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ c = \frac{20d}{19} \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From the fourth equation, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ c = \frac{7d}{14} = \frac{d}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Equating the expressions for \( c \):
