[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find \(0.4 \cdot 0.6\), we can multiply the two numbers directly. Here are the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Align the numbers by their decimal points:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
