[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The direction vector of the line is \(\begin{pmatrix} -2 \\ b \end{pmatrix}\), and this should be perpendicular to the direction vector \(\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\). The dot product of \(\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\) and \(\begin{pmatrix} -2 \\ b \end{pmatrix}\) should be zero:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} -2 & b \end{pmatrix} = 2 \cdot (-2) + (-2) \cdot b = -4 - 2b = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
