[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The \( y \)-axis typically has \( x = h \) as the horizontal axis of symmetry.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Focus and Points**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The focus of the hyperbola is at some point \( (h, k + \sqrt{a^2 + b^2}) \).
