[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      3 = 4 + 2b + c
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      3 - 4 = 2b + c
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      -1 = 2b + c \quad \text{(Equation 1)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - For the point \((4,3)\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      3 = 4^2 + b \cdot 4 + c
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      Simplifying this equation:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      3 = 16 + 4b + c
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      3 - 16 = 4b + c
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      -13 = 4b + c \quad \text{(Equation 2)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Solve the system of linear equations:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    We now have the system:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    -1 = 2b + c \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    -13 = 4b + c
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    To eliminate \( c \), subtract Equation 1 from Equation 2:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    (-13 - (-1)) = (4b + c) - (-2b - c)
