[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c = -6 - 3b \quad \text{(Equation 3)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Substitute \( c \) from Equation 3 into Equation 1:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Substitute \( c = -6 - 3b \) into Equation 1:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
