[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    -1 = -b - 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Add 6 to both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    5 = -b
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    b = -5
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Substitute \( b = -5 \) back into Equation 3:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    c = -6 - 3(-5)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Simplifying this:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
