[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve this problem, we need to find the common solutions to the three inequalities:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (1) & -3y \geq y + 7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (2) & -2y \leq 12 \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (3) & -4y \geq 2y + 17
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's solve each inequality step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Inequality (1):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -3y \geq y + 7
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Subtract \(y\) from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -4y \geq 7
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Divide both sides by \(-4\) (and remember to reverse the inequality sign because we are dividing by a negative number):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m y \leq -\frac{7}{4} = -1.75
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Inequality (2):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -2y \leq 12
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Divide both sides by \(-2\) and reverse the inequality sign:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m y \geq -6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Inequality (3):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -4y \geq 2y + 17
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Add \(4y\) to both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
