[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now we have the inequalities:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1 & y \leq -1.75 \\
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2 & y \geq -6 \\
