[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The values that satisfy all three inequalities are:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m y \leq -1.75 \quad \text{and} \quad y \geq -6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Intersection of the Intervals:
