[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - H has a value of \(0\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - I has a value of \(1\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - L has a value of \(0\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - N has a value of \(1\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - O has a value of \(-1\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - P has a value of \(-2\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Q has a value of \(-1\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - R has a value of \(0\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - S has a value of \(1\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - T has a value of \(0\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - U has a value of \(-1\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Sum the numeric values of the letters in the word "numeric":**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Using the values from step 1, we sum these values:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    1 + 2 + 1 + 0 - 1 - 2 - 1 + 0 + 1 + 2 + 1 + 0 - 1 - 2 - 1 + 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
