[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Simplify the sum:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 1 + 0 - 1 - 2 - 1 + 0 = 0\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - \(-1 - 2 - 1 + 0 = -4\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 1 + 0 = 4\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - \(-4 + 0 = -4\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So, the sum of the numeric values is \(-4\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Putting it all together, the final answer is:
