[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The total number of spaces used for cars and bicycles in the first level is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      60
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      - The number of spaces used for cars in the first level is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m        \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m        10
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m        \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      - The number of spaces used for bicycles in the first level is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m        \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m        50
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m        \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Calculate the number of additional parking spaces available in the first level:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The remaining space after accounting for cars and bicycles in the first level is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
