[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Total cost for all bicycles:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      10p + 60p = 70p
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. **Calculate the total amount of parking fees:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The total number of cars and bicycles today is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      60
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Assuming the parking fee per space is \( p \) dollars, the total amount of parking fees is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
