[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m In an isosceles triangle, one of the angles opposite an equal side is $40^{\circ}$. How many degrees are in the measure of the triangle's largest angle? [asy] draw((0,0)--(6,0)--(3,2)--(0,0)); label("$\backslash$",(1.5,1)); label("{/}",(4.5,1));
