[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the polar form of the complex number \((3 \operatorname{cis} 18^\circ)(-2 \operatorname{cis} 37^\circ)\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -6 \operatorname{cis} 55^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the ordered pair \((r, \theta)\) is:
