[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find \( f^{-1}(f^{-1}(f^{-1}(1))) \), we need to understand the inverse function relationship. Suppose \( f \) and \( f^{-1} \) are inverse functions, so \( f(a) = c \) if and only if \( f^{-1}(c) = a \).
