[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m In the diagram, $PQ$ and $RS$ are diameters of a circle with radius 4.  If $PQ$ and $RS$ are perpendicular, what is the area of the shaded region?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m size(120);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m import graph;
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m fill((-1,-1)--(-1,1)--(1,1)--(1,-1)--cycle,mediumgray);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m fill(Arc((0,0),sqrt(2),45,135)--cycle,mediumgray);fill(Arc((0,0),sqrt(2),225,315)--cycle,mediumgray);
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m draw(Circle((0,0),sqrt(2)));
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m draw((-1,-1)--(1,1)--(1,-1)--(-1,1)--cycle);
