[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m is less than or equal to 400. This sum can be calculated using the formula for the sum of the first \( n \) positive integers:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ S_n = \frac{n(n+1)}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We need to find the largest \( n \) for which \( \frac{n(n+1)}{2} \leq 400 \).
