[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the value of the sum \( -1 + 2 - 3 + 4 - 5 + 6 - 7 + \dots + 1,000,000 \), let's first simplify the series. Notice that each pair of terms in the sequence can be rewritten using the difference of powers:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (1+2) - (3+4) + (5+6) - (7+8) + \dots + (10,000+1,000,000)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Each pair can be simplified as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (1+2) - 3 - 4 + 5 + 6 - 7 - 8 + \dots + 10,001 - 1,000,001 + 10,001
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can rewrite the original sum as:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (1+2) - (3+4) + (5+6) - (7+8) + \dots + (10,001+1,000,000)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1 - 3 + 5 - 7 + 9 - 11 + \dots + 10,199 - 10,000 + 10,199
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we group the pairs together:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (1 - 3) + (5 - 7) + (9 - 11) + \dots + (10,000 - 10,000) + 10,199 - 10,000 + 10,199
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Instead of writing this out completely, we can recognize that this is a telescoping series, where most terms will cancel out. Since there are 10000 terms in total, there are 5000 pairs:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (1 + 10,199) - (3 + 10,000) = 10,200 - 10,003 = 1007
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the value of the sum is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{1007}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
