[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Find the Components of the Vector \( \overrightarrow{CB} \) in the Direction of \( \overrightarrow{AD} \times \overrightarrow{BC} \):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The angle between \( \overrightarrow{AD} \) and \( \overrightarrow{BC} \) is \( \frac{\pi}{4} \) (obtuse angle since the components are along the negative x-axis).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The unit vector in the direction of \( \overrightarrow{AD} \) is \( \left( \frac{-12}{28}, \frac{-24}{28}, \frac{-8}{28} \right) = \left( -\frac{3}{7}, -\frac{6}{7}, -\frac{2}{7} \right) \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The unit vector in the direction of \( \overrightarrow{BC} \) is \( \left( \frac{-24}{28}, \frac{-24}{28}, \frac{-8}{28} \right) = \left( -\frac{6}{7}, -\frac{6}{7}, -\frac{2}{7} \right) \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - We can express these unit vectors as:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \phi = \frac{\overrightarrow{AD} \sin(\theta)}{|\overrightarrow{AD}|} = \frac{28}{28} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \phi = \frac{\overrightarrow{BC} \sin(\theta)}{|\overrightarrow{BC}|} = \frac{28}{28} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
