[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \phi = \frac{\overrightarrow{BC} \sin(\theta + \pi/4)}{|\overrightarrow{BC}|} = \frac{-24}{28} = -\frac{6}{7}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The components of \( \overrightarrow{CB} \) in the direction of \( \overrightarrow{AD} \) times the magnitude \( 28 \) are:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      (-28) \left( -\frac{3}{7}, -\frac{6}{7}, -\frac{2}{7} \right) = \left( 12, 12, -4 \right) \text{ (positive x-component)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
