[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_3 = 8e^{2\pi i / 6} = 8e^{\pi i / 3} = 8\left(\cos \frac{\pi}{3} + i \sin \frac{\pi}{3}\right) = 8\left(\frac{1}{2} + i \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right) = 4 + 4\sqrt{3}i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_4 = 8e^{4\pi i / 6} = 8e^{2\pi i / 3} = 8\left(\cos \frac{2\pi}{3} + i \sin \frac{2\pi}{3}\right) = 8\left(-\frac{1}{2} + i \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right) = -4 + 4\sqrt{3}i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_5 = 8e^{6\pi i / 6} = 8e^{2\pi i / 3} = 8\left(\cos \frac{2\pi}{3} + i \sin \frac{2\pi}{3}\right) = 8\left(-\frac{1}{2} - i \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right) = -4 - 4\sqrt{3}i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_6 = 8e^{8\pi i / 6} = 8e^{4\pi i / 3} = 8\left(\cos \frac{4\pi}{3} + i \sin \frac{4\pi}{3}\right) = 8\left(-\frac{1}{2} - i \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right) = -4 - 4\sqrt{3}i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_7 = 8e^{10\pi i / 6} = 8e^{5\pi i / 3} = 8\left(\cos \frac{5\pi}{3} + i \sin \frac{5\pi}{3}\right) = 8\left(-\frac{1}{2} + i \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right) = -4 + 4\sqrt{3}i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_8 = 8e^{14\pi i / 6} = 8e^{4\pi i / 2} = 8e^{2\pi i} = 8(1 + 0i) = 8,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_9 = 8e^{18\pi i / 6} = 8e^{3\pi i} = 8\left(\cos \frac{3\pi}{2} + i \sin \frac{3\pi}{2}\right) = 8\left(0 + i \frac{1}{2}\right) = 0 + 4i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_{10} = 8e^{22\pi i / 6} = 8e^{7\pi i / 3} = 8\left(\cos \frac{7\pi}{3} + i \sin \frac{7\pi}{3}\right) = 8\left(-\frac{1}{2} - i \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right) = -4 - 4\sqrt{3}i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[z_{11} = 8e^{26\pi i / 6} = 8e^{8\pi i / 3} = 8\left(\cos \frac{8\pi}{3} + i \sin \frac{8\pi}{3}\right) = 8\left(\frac{1}{2} - i \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right) = 4 - 4\sqrt{3}i,\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m and
