[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Prime factorization of 3317:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    We need to find the prime factors of 3317. We check divisibility by the smallest prime numbers:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - \( 3317 \) is odd, so it is not divisible by 2.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The sum of the digits of \( 3317 \) is \( 3 + 3 + 1 + 7 = 14 \), which is not divisible by 3.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - \( 3317 \) does not end in 0 or 5, so it is not divisible by 5.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Check divisibility by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
