[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The circle is a unit circle.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Angle \( QAT \) is given as 42 degrees.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Understand the relationship between angles and arcs:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - The measure of an arc in a circle is equal to the angle subtended by that arc at the center of the circle.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - Therefore, the measure of arc \( AK \) is equal to the measure of angle \( QAT \).
