[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Conclusion:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Since \( \angle QAT = 42 \) degrees, the measure of arc \( AK \) is also 42 degrees.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the measure of minor arc \( AK \) is \(\boxed{42}\).<|endoftext|>
