[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve the problem \((q+4)(p+3) - (q+2)(p+1) = 44\), we will first expand and simplify the left-hand side of the equation.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, we expand the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (q+4)(p+3) = pq + 3q + 4p + 12
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (q+2)(p+1) = pq + q + 2p + 2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we substitute these expansions into the original equation:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pq + 3q + 4p + 12 - (pq + q + 2p + 2) = 44
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we simplify the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pq + 3q + 4p + 12 - pq - q - 2p - 2 = 44
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3q + 4p + 10 - 4p - 2q - 2 = 44
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -p + q + 8 = 44
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we isolate \(p + q\) by adding 1 to both sides of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -p + q + 8 + 1 = 44 + 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -p + q + 9 = 45
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we need to isolate \(p + q\). We do this by adding \(-9\) to both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -p + q + 9 + (-9) = 45 - 9
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -p + q = 36
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The value of \(p + q\) is \(-36\). Therefore, the final answer is:
