[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we substitute back into the Law of Sines:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{BC}{\frac{2}{3}} = \frac{12 \sqrt{10}}{\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
