[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let $a_1 , a_2 , \dots$ be a sequence for which  $a_1=2$ , $a_2=3$, and $a_n=\frac{a_{n-1}}{a_{n-2}}$ for each positive integer $n \ge 3$.  What is $a_{2006}$?
