[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the value of \( x \) that produces a sequence of maximum length for the sequence \( 1000, x, 1000 - x, \ldots \), we need to analyze the sequence and determine when it stops increasing or when it is the first negative term encountered.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The sequence can be written as \( 1000, x, 1000 - x, y, 1000 - y, \ldots \), where \( y = x(1000 - x) \). Now, let's write out the terms of the sequence:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. \( 1000 \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. \( x \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. \( 1000 - x \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. \( y \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. \( 1000 - y \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. \( 1100 - (y + x) \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 7. \( 1100 - 2y \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 8. \( 1100 - x - 2y - x(1000 - x) \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 9. \( 1100 - x - 2y - x(1000 - x) - x(1000 - x) \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 10. \( 1100 - 2x - 3x^2 \)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can see that the sequence will stop increasing after the term \( 1100 - y \) because it is the last term before we encounter a negative term. Substituting \( y = x(1000 - x) \) into the sequence, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - x(1000 - x) = 1100 - 1000x + x^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2y = 1100 - 2x - 2y - 2x(1000 - x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2y = 1100 - 2x - 2y - 2x(1000 - x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2y = 1100 - 2x - 2y - 2x(1000 - x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2y = 1100 - 2x - 2y - 2x(1000 - x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2y = 1100 - 2x - 2y - 2x(1000 - x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2y = 1100 - 2x - 2y - 2x(1000 - x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2x = 1100 - (2x + 2y) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2x = 1100 - (-2x - 2y) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2x = 1100 - (-2x - 2(-1100 + x) - 2x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2x = 1100 + 2x + 2200 - 2x - 2x \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 1100 - 2x = 3300 + 2x \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 150 = 4x \]
