[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \( x = 37.5 \) is not an integer, we need to check the integer values of \( x \). We need to check the values of \( y \) to ensure \( y \) is an integer. Let's check small integer values of \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
