[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m If \( x = 5 \), the sequence is \( 1000, 5, 989, 9, 977 \), which does not stop increasing.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m If \( x = 6 \), the sequence is \( 1000, 6, 987, 10, 975 \), which does not stop increasing.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m If \( x = 7 \), the sequence is \( 1000, 7, 985, 11, 973 \), which does not stop increasing.
