[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Subtract \( 3M_{\text{future}} \) from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ M_{\text{future}} - 1 = -3 \]
