[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ M_{\text{future}} = -2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since a year cannot be negative in this context, we need to re-evaluate our approach. Let's instead solve the equation directly by setting up the correct future year equation correctly:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We know Marika's age in the year \( M_{\text{future}} \) will be:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ M_{\text{future}} - 1 = 2M_{\text{future}} \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the correct future year is 2005, and Marika's age in 2005 will be:
