[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given that the repeating cycle length in \( x \) is 6 (since \( 0.ababab \) is 18 digits long when expressed with repeating block 'ab'), we need to find \( y \) such that \( 0.ababab \) repeats every 6 digits. This implies:
