[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the remainder when \(3z^3 - 4z^2 - 14z + 3\) is divided by \(3z + 5\), we use the polynomial remainder theorem. According to the theorem, the remainder of the division of a polynomial \(f(z)\) by a linear divisor \(z - c\) is \(f(c)\). Here, \(c = -5\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given \(f(z) = 3z^3 - 4z^2 - 14z + 3\), we need to find \(f(-5)\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, substitute \(z = -5\) into the polynomial:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-5) = 3(-5)^3 - 4(-5)^2 - 14(-5) + 3
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, calculate each term:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3(-5)^3 = 3(-125) = -375
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -4(-5)^2 = -4(25) = -100
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -14(-5) = 70
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3 = 3
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Combine these results:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-5) = -375 - 100 + 70 + 3
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplify step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -375 - 100 = -475
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -475 + 70 = -395
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -395 + 3 = -392
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the remainder when \(3z^3 - 4z^2 - 14z + 3\) is divided by \(3z + 5\) is \(\boxed{-392}\).<|endoftext|>
