[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To simplify the fraction \(\frac{4}{\sqrt{108} + 2\sqrt{12} + 2\sqrt{27}}\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Simplify the square roots in the denominator:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \sqrt{108} = \sqrt{36 \times 3} = \sqrt{36} \times \sqrt{3} = 6\sqrt{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \sqrt{12} = \sqrt{4 \times 3} = \sqrt{4} \times \sqrt{3} = 2\sqrt{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \sqrt{27} = \sqrt{9 \times 3} = \sqrt{9} \times \sqrt{3} = 3\sqrt{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Substitute these simplified forms back into the original fraction:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{4}{\sqrt{108} + 2\sqrt{12} + 2\sqrt{27}} = \frac{4}{6\sqrt{3} + 2 \cdot 2\sqrt{3} + 3\sqrt{3}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Simplify the terms inside the square roots:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    6\sqrt{3} + 2 \cdot 2\sqrt{3} + 3\sqrt{3} = 6\sqrt{3} + 4\sqrt{3} + 3\sqrt{3} = 13\sqrt{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Rewrite the fraction with the simplified terms:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{4}{13\sqrt{3}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Rationalize the denominator by multiplying the numerator and the denominator by \(\sqrt{3}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{4}{13\sqrt{3}} \times \frac{\sqrt{3}}{\sqrt{3}} = \frac{4\sqrt{3}}{13 \times 3} = \frac{4\sqrt{3}}{39}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the simplified form of the fraction is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{\frac{4\sqrt{3}}{39}}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
