[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's start by combining the fractions.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{1}{(x - 1)(x - 2)} + \frac{1}{(x - 2)(x - 3)} + \frac{1}{(x - 3)(x - 4)} = \frac{1}{6}.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, combine the fractions on the left-hand side:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
