[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Add these values together:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2662 + 1089 + 11 + 1 = 3763
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, \(2911_{11} = 3763_{10}\).
