[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To convert \(403_{10}\) to base-7, we divide the number by 7 and keep track of the remainders:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
