[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get the base-7 representation of \(403_{10}\) as \(1112_7\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step 2: Check each digit in base-7
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
