[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m - The digit \(1\) is odd.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m - The digit \(1\) is odd.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m - The digit \(2\) is even.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the digit that is even is \(2\).
