[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \( k \) must be an integer, there seems to be an error in the setup or interpretation. Let's recheck the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
