[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the number of boys who didn't bring their calculators to class is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 16 - 2 = 14 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the number of boys who didn't bring their calculators to class is \(\boxed{14}\).<|endoftext|>
