[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. For a parabola of the form \(y^2 = -4px\), the focus is at \((h, k + p)\). Since \(h = 0\) and \(k = 0\), the focus is at \((0, 0 + (-3)) = (-3, 0)\).
