[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Divide both sides by 5:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[a = 19\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The smallest integer among the five integers is \(a\), which is 19.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
