[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the magnitude of the projection of vector \(\mathbf{v}\) onto vector \(\mathbf{w}\), we use the formula for the magnitude of a projection. The formula for the magnitude of the projection of vector \(\mathbf{v}\) onto vector \(\mathbf{w}\) is given by:
