[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To express the complex number \((3 \operatorname{cis} 18^\circ)(-2 \operatorname{cis} 37^\circ)\) in polar form as \(r \operatorname{cis} \theta\), we will use the properties of complex numbers and polar forms.
