[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the total cost of the groceries is $34.98$ dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, let's compare this total to the given options:
