[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m or
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ -x = 50 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve for \( x \), we multiply both sides by -1:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ x = -50 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, let's check our solution by substituting \( x = -50 \) back into the original equation to make sure it holds true.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The original equation is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ x - 2x + 3x - 4x + 5x - 6x + 7x - 8x + 9x - 10x = 50 \]
