[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Clear the fraction by multiplying both sides by 27:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    216x^3 - 1296x^2 + 540x - 216 = x^9 + 6x^6 + 12x^3 + 8
