[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Find the sum of the values of $x$ such that $\cos^{3}3x+\cos^{3}5x= 8\cos^{3}4x\cos^{3}x$, where $x$ is measured in degrees and $100 ^\circ < x < 200^\circ$.
