[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    y = 31 - 17 = 14
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Determine the Larger Number:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    The larger number is \( x \), which is 17.
