[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now add the fractions:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m x + y + z = \frac{275 - 60 + 186}{45} = \frac{411 - 60}{45} = \frac{351}{45} = 7.8
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
