[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Compute $\tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{3\pi}{7}\right)$.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To compute \(\tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{3\pi}{7}\right)\), we will use properties of trigonometry and series. We start by using the symmetry of the tangent function.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, consider the sum of the tangents of the arguments:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{3\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can pair each tangent term \(\tan\left(\frac{k\pi}{7}\right)\) with \(\tan\left(\frac{6-k\pi}{7}\right)\) for \(k = 1, 2, 3\). This pairing is based on the periodicity and symmetry properties of the tangent function.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Pair \(\tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\) and \(\tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) = \left(\frac{1}{\tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)}\right)^2 = \frac{1}{\tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)} = \tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Pair \(\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\) and \(\tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right)\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) = \frac{\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)}{\tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)} = \frac{1}{\tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)} = \tan\left(\pi - \frac{\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Pair \(\tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)\) and \(\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) = \frac{\tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)}{\tan^2\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)} = \frac{1}{\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)} = \frac{1}{\tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)} = \tan\left(\pi - \frac{\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, add the evaluated pairs:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Notice that:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) = \tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) = 3\tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can use the fact that \(\tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7} + \frac{\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) \cot\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Similarly,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right) = 3\tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Notice that:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right) \cot\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) = \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) = 3\tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) + \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \(\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) = \frac{1}{\tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)} + \frac{1}{\tan^2\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)} = \frac{\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)}{\tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan^2\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)} = \frac{\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)}{\frac{1}{\tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan^2\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)}} = \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan^2\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)\left(\frac{\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)}{1}\right) = \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan^2\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)\left(\tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)\right)\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) + \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) = 3\tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) + \tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right) + \frac{1}{\tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan^2\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)}\left(\tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{4\pi}{7}\right)\right) \approx 3\tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + 3\tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \tan\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right) \approx 3\tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) + 3\tan\left(\frac{5\pi}{7}\right) + \frac{\tan^2\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)}{\tan^2\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan^2\left(\frac{6\pi}{7}\right)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m After careful calculation, we find:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{2\pi}{7}\right)\tan\left(\frac{3\pi}{7}\right) = \boxed{1}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
