[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Is $f(x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x|$ an even function, odd function, or neither?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Enter "odd", "even", or "neither".
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine whether the function \( f(x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x| \) is even, odd, or neither, we need to analyze its properties under the transformation \( x \to -x \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step 1: Check for Even Function
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A function \( f(x) \) is even if \( f(-x) = f(x) \) for all \( x \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given \( f(x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x| \), we substitute \( -x \) into the function:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) = 3^{(-x)^2-3} - |-x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplify \( (-x)^2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (-x)^2 = x^2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |-x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we consider \( |-x| \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m |-x| = |-x| = |x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \( f(-x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x| \), we see that:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) \neq f(x) \quad \text{and} \quad f(-x) \neq -f(x)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, \( f(x) \) is not even.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step 2: Check for Odd Function
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m A function \( f(x) \) is odd if \( f(-x) = -f(x) \) for all \( x \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given \( f(x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x| \), we substitute \( -x \) into the function:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) = 3^{(-x)^2-3} - |-x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplify \( (-x)^2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (-x)^2 = x^2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |-x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we consider \( |-x| \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m |-x| = |-x| = |x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x|
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \( f(-x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x| \), we see that:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(-x) \neq -f(x) \quad \text{and} \quad f(-x) \neq f(x)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, \( f(x) \) is not odd.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Conclusion
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Based on both the analysis, we conclude that the function \( f(x) = 3^{x^2-3} - |x| \) is neither even nor odd.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{neither}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{even}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
