[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The same amount of steel used to create eight solid steel balls, each with a radius of 1 inch, is used to create one larger steel ball. What is the radius of the larger ball?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [asy]
