[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, \(u = \arctan(\sqrt{3})\) or \(u = \arctan(-\sqrt{3})\). Since \(\arctan(\sqrt{3}) = \frac{\pi}{3}\), we have:
