[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The method involves finding the multiples of 9 within the range of 1 to 200 that leave a remainder of 1 when divided by 9. Mathematically, this can be expressed as \(200 = 9n + 1\) for some integer \(n\). We need to find the largest integer \(n\) such that this equation holds true and is within the range from 1 to 200.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
