[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Write the final factored form:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    The expression is now factored completely.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    13x^3(4 - 9x^4)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
