[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step-by-Step Solution:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Find the decimal expansion of \(\frac{141}{400}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    To convert \(\frac{141}{400}\) to a decimal, we perform the division \(141 \div 400\).
