[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3x^2 + (2a + 2b + 2c)x = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since this sum is zero, the expression is zero. Therefore, the simplified form of the given expression is:
