[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m First, let's find the intersections for each set of endpoints:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. For \(x = 1\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
