[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    This equation is not straightforward to solve analytically, so we will solve numerically. We can use the fact that \(\cos t\) is periodic with period \(2\pi\) and \(u = t\) to find intersections. We will solve this numerically.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. For \(x = 40\):
