[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's simplify each term by expressing them in their simplest integer forms:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. \(\sqrt{4096}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
