[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \sqrt{4096} = \sqrt{2^{12}} = 2^6 = 64
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
