[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    4096 = 2^{12}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \sqrt[3]{4096} = \sqrt[3]{2^{12}} = 2^4 = 16
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
