[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    So, 8 is a rational number because it can be expressed as a fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. \(\sqrt[5]{4096}\):
