[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Find a unit vector that is orthogonal to both $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 1 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}.$
