[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the total volume of three boxes, each with an edge length of 4 feet, we will calculate the volume of one box and then multiply it by 3.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. Calculate the volume of one box:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    The volume \( V \) of a cube with edge length \( a \) is given by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
