[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m - **15**: \(15^2 = 225\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m - **24**: \(24^2 = 576\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m - **33**: \(33^2 = 1089\)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m All these are three-digit numbers but are not palindromes because they do not meet the criteria of having the same digits written in the opposite order (e.g., 225 is not a palindrom).
