[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Since this equality holds true for all \(x \neq 0\), the two expressions are equivalent for all positive and negative \(x\). Therefore, we need to confirm that they are not identically equal for any other \(x\). Since \(x = 0\) would make the fractions undefined, \(x \neq 0\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
