[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Is \(\frac{1-h}{2h}\) equivalent to \(\frac{h-1}{2h}\)?**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    To compare these two expressions, we can cross-multiply and see if the fractions still equal differently:
