[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine the value of \( n \) in the seven-digit number \( 854n526 \) such that the number is divisible by \( 11 \), we can use the divisibility rule for \( 11 \). The rule states that a number is divisible by \( 11 \) if the difference between the sum of the digits in the odd positions and the sum of the digits in the even positions is a multiple of \( 11 \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m For the number \( 854n526 \), the digits in the odd positions are \( 8, 4, 5, \) and \( 6 \), and the digits in the even positions are \( 5, n, 2, \) and \( 2 \). Therefore, we can write:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m (8 + 4 + 5 + 6) - (5 + n + 2 + 2) = 20 - (8 + n + 5)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplifying the expression inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 20 - (14 + n) = 20 - 14 - n = 6 - n
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We need \( 6 - n \) to be a multiple of \( 11 \). The possible values of \( n \) that satisfy this condition are those that make \( 6 - n \) a multiple of \( 11 \). The only value of \( n \) that satisfies this is when \( n \) is \( 4 \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6 - 4 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To verify, we check the divisibility of \( 854n526 \) by \( 11 \) with \( n = 4 \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 8544526 \div 11 = 7806374
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since \( 7806374 \) is an integer, the number is divisible by \( 11 \). Therefore, the value of \( n \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{4}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
