[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(2) = \frac{b}{2(2) - 3} = \frac{b}{4 - 3} = \frac{b}{1} = b \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, \( f(2) = b \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we need to determine the inverse function \( f^{-1}(x) \). To do this, we start with the equation:
