[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(2) = b \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(2) = f^{-1}(b+1) = b + 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This implies:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ b = b + 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's re-evaluate the problem correctly. We should have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(2) = b \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m and:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f(2) = b + 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From the correct interpretation, we realize:
