[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The gcd of two 12-digit numbers will be the gcd of the digits of their maximum representations. The digits of these numbers are all 2 and 4, respectively. The maximum digits are 4, so let's find the gcd of 9 and 4.
