[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we can rewrite the original expression with these factored forms:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 46x^3(1 - 25x^4) = 46x^3(x^2 - 5x)(x^2 + 5x) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The expression \(x^2 - 5x\) and \(x^2 + 5x\) are both quadratic expressions, and there is no common factor that can be factored further into other terms, so the completely factored form is:
