[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m And so on. We observe that \( f(n) \) is simply the sum of the first \( n \) natural numbers, which can be represented by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(n) = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
