[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m f(2018) = \frac{2018 \cdot 2019}{2} = \frac{4075920}{2} = 2037960
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
