[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. Combine the like terms (real parts and imaginary parts separately).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let's start with the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
