[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Since we are considering the beginning tuition fee for children aged 3-5, we can round up to the nearest whole number for the calculation. Let's assume the family has rations, and the monthly budget for the tuition reflects the given percentage. For simplicity, let's say the family can allocate $200 to the tuition for children aged 3-5.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
