[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ### Step 5: Determine the product of the roots
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The product of the roots of a polynomial \(a_n x^9 + a_{n-1} x^8 + \cdots + a_1 x + a_0 = 0\) is given by \((-1)^n \frac{a_0}{a_n}\). For our polynomial, \(a_9 = 20\) and \(a_0 = 20\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
