[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m So, the rationalized form of \(\frac{1}{2\sqrt{7}}\) is \(\boxed{\frac{\sqrt{7}}{14}}\).<|endoftext|>
