[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To express \(0.\overline{5} + 0.\overline{1} - 0.\overline{3}\) as a common fraction, we will first convert each repeating decimal into a fraction.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Convert \(0.\overline{5}\) to a fraction:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Let \(x = 0.\overline{5}\). Then,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    10x = 5.\overline{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Subtracting \(x\) from \(10x\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    10x - x = 5.\overline{5} - 0.\overline{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    9x = 5
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    x = \frac{5}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Convert \(0.\overline{1}\) to a fraction:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Let \(y = 0.\overline{1}\). Then,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    10y = 1.\overline{1}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Subtracting \(y\) from \(10y\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    10y - y = 1.\overline{1} - 0.\overline{1}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    9y = 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    y = \frac{1}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Convert \(0.\overline{3}\) to a fraction:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Let \(z = 0.\overline{3}\). Then,
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    10z = 3.\overline{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Subtracting \(z\) from \(10z\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    10z - z = 3.\overline{3} - 0.\overline{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
