[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    This is because:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{1}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Convert \(0.\overline{3}\) to a fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    0.\overline{3} = \frac{3}{9} = \frac{1}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    This is because:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
