[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To combine these fractions, we need a common denominator. The least common multiple of 9 and 3 is 9. Convert \(\frac{1}{3}\) to a fraction with a denominator of 9:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{1}{3} = \frac{3}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
