[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We solve the third equation first:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3a + 7 = 25
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Subtract 7 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3a = 18
