[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. Calculate \(1^{2006}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    1^{2006} = 1 \quad \text{(any nonzero number raised to any power is 1)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. Calculate \(1^{2007}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    1^{2007} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, substitute these values back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m -1 + (-1) + 1 - 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplify step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
