[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Marguerite drove 100 miles in 2.4 hours. If Sam drove for 3 hours at the same average rate as Marguerite, how many miles did he drive?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine how many miles Sam drove, we first need to find his driving speed. We know that Marguerite drove 100 miles in 2.4 hours. Therefore, her driving speed is calculated as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Speed of Marguerite} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Time}} = \frac{100 \text{ miles}}{2.4 \text{ hours}} = \frac{100}{2.4} \text{ miles per hour}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplifying the fraction, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{100}{2.4} = \frac{1000}{24} = \frac{500}{12} = \frac{250}{6} = \frac{125}{3} \approx 41.67 \text{ miles per hour}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now that we know Sam's driving speed is \(\frac{125}{3}\) hours per mile, we can calculate the distance he drove in 3 hours. Using the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Distance} = \text{Speed} \times \text{Time} = \frac{125}{3} \text{ miles per hour} \times 3 \text{ hours} = \frac{125}{3} \times 3 = 125 \text{ miles}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the number of miles Sam drove is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{125}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 125\textnormal{ miles}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
