[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - **Divisibility by 5**: The last digit of 607 is 7, so it is not divisible by 5.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - **Divisibility by 7**: Perform the division \(607 \div 7 \approx 86.714\), which is not an integer, so 607 is not divisible by 7.
