[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ----+-----
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6   3   E
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From the second equation, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m E = (6 + 6) - 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m E = 12 - 6
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
