[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Calculate \( |z|^2 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    |z|^2 = 13^2 = 169
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **State the final answer:**
