[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We need to find the value of \( t \) such that:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ \lim_{t \to \infty} f(t) = \lim_{t \to -\infty} f(t) = c \]
