[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    for some integer \( k \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Determine the largest integer**: We are looking for the largest integer \( x \) less than 80. To find this, we start with the largest possible value of \( k \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Set up the inequality**: From the form \( x = 5k + 3 \), we set up the inequality:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
