[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Solve for \( k \)**: Subtract 3 from both sides of the inequality:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    5k < 77
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
