[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Since \( k \) must be an integer, the largest possible value for \( k \) is 14.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Find the largest integer \( x \)**: Substitute \( k = 14 \) back into the equation \( x = 5k + 3 \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
