[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Simplify the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    x = 70 + 3 = 73
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 6. **Verify the solution**: Check that 73 is less than 80:
