[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. If \(A = 4\), \(M = 3\), and \(C = 6\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[A \cdot M \cdot C + A \cdot M + M \cdot C + C \cdot A = 4 \cdot 3 \cdot 6 + 4 \cdot 3 + 3 \cdot 6 + 6 \cdot 4 = 72 + 12 + 18 + 24 = 126.\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    This value is less than 1.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. If \(A = 5\), \(M = 2\), and \(C = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[A \cdot M \cdot C + A \cdot M + M \cdot C + C \cdot A = 5 \cdot 2 \cdot 5 + 5 \cdot 2 + 2 \cdot 5 + 5 \cdot 2 = 50 + 10 + 10 + 10 = 80.\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    This value is greater than 1.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. If \(A = 6\), \(M = 1\), and \(C = 6\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[A \cdot M \cdot C + A \cdot M + M \cdot C + C \cdot A = 6 \cdot 1 \cdot 6 + 6 \cdot 1 + 1 \cdot 6 + 6 \cdot 1 = 36 + 6 + 6 + 6 = 54.\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    This value is greater than 1.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From the above calculations, the maximum value of the expression is 126, which occurs when \(A = 5\), \(M = 2\), and \(C = 5\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
