[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the constants \(A\), \(B\), \(C\), \(D\), and \(E\), we need to combine the right-hand side over a common denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{A}{x} + \frac{B}{x + 1} + \frac{C}{x + 2} + \frac{D}{x + 3} + \frac{E}{x + 4} = \frac{A(x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)(x + 4) + Bx(x + 2)(x + 3)(x + 4) + Cx(x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 4) + Dx(x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 4) + Ex(x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)}{x(x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)(x + 4)}
