[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Equate the numerators:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1 = A(x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)(x + 4) + Bx(x + 2)(x + 3)(x + 4) + Cx(x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 4) + Dx(x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 4) + Ex(x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find \(A\), \(B\), \(C\), \(D\), and \(E\), we can use the fact that \(x = -1\), \(x = -2\), \(x = -3\), \(x = -4\) must be zero, and set up the system of equations.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
