[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Combine the exponents**: The expression \(10^{0.5} \cdot 10^{0.3} \cdot 10^{0.2} \cdot 10^{0.1} \cdot 10^{0.9}\) can be combined into a single exponent by using the property of exponents for multiplying powers with the same base:
