[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve for the measure of angle \( M \), we need to understand the complement of angle \( M \). The complement of an angle is the angle that, when added to the given angle, gives 90 degrees. Given that the complement of angle \( M \) is 10 degrees, we can set up the following equation:
