[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[bc + 4c + 4c = -16 + 4c \implies bc + 8c = -16 + 4c \implies bc = -4c - 16 \implies c(b - 4) = -16\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Similarly, we can express \(ab + 4b = -16\) in a similar way:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[a(b - 4) = -16\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m And, we can express \(ca + 4a = -16\) in a similar way:
