[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From these, we can add all three equations together:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[a(b - 4) + b(c - 4) + c(a - 4) = -16 + 16 + 16 \implies a(b - 4) + b(c - 4) + c(a - 4) = 16 \implies 3a(b - 4) + 3c(b - 4) + 3c(a - 4) = 16 \implies a(b - 4) + c(a - 4) + b(c - 4) = 16\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This can be factored as:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[(ab + 4b) + (bc + 4c) + (ca + 4a) = 16 \implies (ab + 4b) + (bc + 4c) + (ca + 4a) = 16 \implies a(b - 4) + b(c - 4) + c(a - 4) + 8 = 16 \implies a(b - 4) + b(c - 4) + c(a - 4) = 8\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From this, we see that:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[a(b - 4) + b(c - 4) + c(a - 4) = 8\]
