[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since we know that \(c(b - 4) = -16\), we substitute this in:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[a(b - 4) + b(-16) + c(a - 4) = 8 \implies a(b - 4) - 16b + ac - 4c = 8\]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Separating terms involving \(a\) and \(b\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[(a - 4)a + (b - 4)b = 12 \implies a^2 + b^2 - 8a - 8b + 16 = 12 \implies a^2 + b^2 - 8a - 8b = -4\]
