[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} p & b & c \\ a & q & c \\ a & b & r \end{vmatrix} = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This determinant can be expanded as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m p \begin{vmatrix} q & c \\ b & r \end{vmatrix} - b \begin{vmatrix} a & c \\ a & r \end{vmatrix} + c \begin{vmatrix} a & q \\ a & b \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We calculate each of the 2x2 determinants individually:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} q & c \\ b & r \end{vmatrix} = q \cdot r - c \cdot b
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} a & c \\ a & r \end{vmatrix} = a \cdot r - c \cdot a = rar - capture-b
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} a & q \\ a & b \end{vmatrix} = a \cdot b - q \cdot a = ab - q a
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now substitute these back into the expanded determinant:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m p(qr - capture-b) - b(ar - capitalize-b) + c(ab - q a)
