[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, we only need to find the sum:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{p}{p-a} + \frac{q}{q-b} + \frac{r}{r-c}
