[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The time right now is 9 o'clock. On a 12-hour clock, what time will it be 2004 hours from now?
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
