[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - **Divisible by 89:** Perform the division: \(9879 \div 89 = 107\). So, 9879 = 89 × 107.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - **Divisible by 97:** Perform the division: \(9879 \div 97 = 103\). So, 9879 = 97 × 103.
