[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \text{Weekly earnings for school year} = \$300 \text{ per week} \times 30 \text{ weeks} = \$9000
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Determine the remaining amount she needs to earn:**
