[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, when cube $x$, you get $x^3$, and when you add up how many equal parts of $x$ and 12, you still can't figure out how to separate that 0.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This means $x$ has to be 0, but 0 cannot be split into 12. So, the final answer is x=0.
