[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{a}{b} = \frac{a}{\frac{1}{3}c} = \frac{a \cdot 3}{c} = \frac{a}{c}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We know \(\frac{a}{b} = 4\), so:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{a}{c} = 4
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We also know \(c = 6d\), so:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m a = 4c = 4 \cdot 6d = 24d
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we substitute \(a = 24d\) and \(c = 6d\) into the expression for \(\frac{d}{a}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{d}{a} = \frac{d}{24d} = \frac{1}{24}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the value of \(\frac{d}{a}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
