[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 14 + 13 = 27 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ 27 + 52 = 79 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the sum of the first four terms of the sequence is:
