[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we sum these products:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3125 + 0 + 125 + 0 + 5 + 0 = 3265
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the base 10 equivalent of $101010_5$ is \(\boxed{3265}\).<|endoftext|>
