[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To determine the average of the integers \(71, 72, 73, 74, 75\), we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1. **Add all the integers together:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
