[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To simplify \(\sin 17^\circ + \sin 43^\circ\), we can use the angle addition formula for sine, which states:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin(a + b) = \sin a \cos b + \cos a \sin b
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m In this problem, let \(a = 17^\circ\) and \(b = 43^\circ\). Applying the formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 17^\circ + \sin 43^\circ = \sin 17^\circ \cos 43^\circ + \cos 17^\circ \sin 43^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m This can be rewritten using the angle addition formula by separating the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 17^\circ + \sin 43^\circ = \sin(17^\circ + 43^\circ)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we add the angles:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin(17^\circ + 43^\circ) = \sin 60^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We know from trigonometry that \(\sin 60^\circ = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\). Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 17^\circ + \sin 43^\circ = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Substituting back the original variable names, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \sin 17^\circ + \sin 43^\circ = \sin 7
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the simplified form of \(\sin 17^\circ + \sin 43^\circ\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{\sin 7}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
