[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the mean of the set \(\{n, n + 5, n + 6, n + 9, n + 15\}\), we start by identifying the value of \(n\). Since the median of a set of five numbers is the third number when the set is arranged in ascending order, we have:
