[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m n, n + 5, n + 6, n + 9, n + 15
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m The median is the third number in this ordered set, which is \(n + 6\). We are given that the median is 9, so we set up the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m n + 6 = 9
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find \(n\), we solve the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m n = 9 - 6 = 3
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now that we have \(n = 3\), we substitute this value back into the set of the given numbers:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \{3, 8, 9, 12, 18\}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we calculate the mean of this set. The mean is given by the sum of the values divided by the number of values. Since there are 5 values, the mean is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Mean} = \frac{3 + 8 + 9 + 12 + 18}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We add the numbers together:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3 + 8 + 9 + 12 + 18 = 40
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we divide by 5:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{Mean} = \frac{40}{5} = 8
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the mean of the set \(\{n, n + 5, n + 6, n + 9, n + 15\}\) is \(\boxed{8}\).<|endoftext|>
