[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    22^4 \cdot 234256 = -\frac{e}{a}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Since \( 234256 = 22^4 \cdot 27 \), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    22^4 = 22^3 \cdot 27 = 2\cdot22^2 = 2\cdot22 \cdot 22 = 4\cdot22 \cdot 22 = 4312
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    4312 \cdot 234256 = -\frac{e}{a}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    234256 \cdot 27 = -\frac{e}{a}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
