[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We need to find the fifth term of the sequence. This corresponds to \(n = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m a_5 = (-1)^{5+1} 5 = (-1)^6 \cdot 5 = 1 \cdot 5 = 5
