[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - There are 7 items in circle \( C \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - There are 20 items in circle \( A \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 2. **Identify the number of items not in \( B \):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - There are 10 items which are not in circle \( B \).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 3. **Subtract the items not in \( B \) from the total items in \( A \) to find the items in \( A \cap B \):**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
