[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      0 = 18.5.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - This also does not work.
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 9. **Conclusion:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    - After checking multiple values, we find that the smallest possible value of \( n \) that satisfies the equation is indeed \( n = 5 \), as it balances the sums without causing the absolute value to exceed 19.
