[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Circles with centers $A$ and $B$ have radii  3 and 8, respectively. A common internal tangent touches the circles at $C$ and $D$, as shown. Lines $AB$ and $CD$ intersect at $E$, and $AE = 5$. What is $CD$?
