[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let $a,$ $b,$ $c,$ $p,$ $q,$ and $r$ be real numbers such that
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} p & b & c \\ a & q & c \\ a & b & r \end{vmatrix} = 0.\]Assuming that $a \neq p,$ $b \neq q,$ and $c \neq r,$ find the value of $\frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c}.$
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To solve the given problem, we start by considering the determinant of the given matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} p & b & c \\ a & q & c \\ a & b & r \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can expand this determinant along the first row:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m p \begin{vmatrix} q & c \\ b & r \end{vmatrix} - b \begin{vmatrix} a & c \\ a & r \end{vmatrix} + c \begin{vmatrix} a & q \\ a & b \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we calculate each of the 2x2 determinants:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} q & c \\ b & r \end{vmatrix} = qr - bc
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} a & c \\ a & r \end{vmatrix} = ar - ac = r(a - c)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \begin{vmatrix} a & q \\ a & b \end{vmatrix} = ab - aq = a(b - q)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Substituting these back into the expansion, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m p(qr - bc) - b(r(a - c)) + c(a(b - q)) = pqr - pbc - b(ra + bc) + cab - abc = pqr - pbc - b(ra + bc) + cab
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Since the determinant is zero, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pqr - pbc - b(ra + bc) + cab = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can factor out common terms:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pqr - pbc = b(ra + bc) - cab
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Simplifying the right-hand side, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m b(ra + bc) - cab = b(a(r - c) + bc) = b(ra - ac + bc)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Combining the terms, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pqr - b(ra - ac + bc) = b(ra - ac + bc) = b\left(ra - ac + bc\right)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Given that \(a \neq p\), \(b \neq q\), and \(c \neq r\), we can divide both sides by \(b\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pqr - r\left(a - c + bc\right) = r
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Rearranging terms, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pqr = r(p - a) + r(c - b) + r(a - c)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Factoring out \(r\) on the right-hand side, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m pqr = r(p - a) + r(c - b) + r(a - c)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m We can express \(\frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c}\) as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c} = \frac{pq + qr + pr}{(p - a)(q - b)(r - c)}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m From the expression \(pqr = r(p - a) + r(c - b) + r(a - c)\), we can substitute \(r(p - a) = 0\), \(r(c - b) = 0\), and \(r(a - c) = 0\) into the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c} = \frac{pq + qr + pr}{0} = \frac{pq + qr + pr}{0} = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the value is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{0}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
