[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Next, we will add these values step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 625 + 125 = 750
