[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the length of \( AB \) in the triangle \( \triangle ABC \) where \( AK \) is an altitude, \( AC = 9 \), \( BK = \sqrt{5} \), and \( CK = 4 \), we will follow these steps:
