[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Since both expressions represent the same area:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{1}{2} \times AC \times AK = \frac{1}{2} \times BC \times AK
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Canceling out the common factor \( AK \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \frac{1}{2} \times AC = \frac{1}{2} \times BC
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
