[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ f^{-1}(g(x)) = x^3 - 1 \implies g(x) = f(x^3 - 1) \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Now, we need to find \( g^{-1}(f(7)) \). To do this, we set \( f(a) = 7 \) and solve for \( a \) in terms of \( g \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[ g(a) = 7 \implies a^3 - 1 = 7 \implies a^3 = 8 \implies a = 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
