[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    1^3 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 4. **Combine all the terms:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    (101 + 1)^3 = 1010101 + 30603 + 303 + 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 5. **Sum the coefficients:**
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    1010101 + 30603 + 303 + 1 = 1013198
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Therefore, the value of \(101^3 - 3 \cdot 101^2 + 3 \cdot 101 - 1\) is:
