[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    g(x) = 3x + 7
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    Substitute \( x = 8 \) into the function \( g(x) \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m    \[
