[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Solving for \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m x = 180^\circ - 100^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m x = 80^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the value of \( x \) is \(\boxed{80}\).<|endoftext|>
