[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Let $\mathbf{R}$ be the matrix for rotating about the origin counter-clockwise by an angle of $58^\circ.$  Find $\det \mathbf{R}.$
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m To find the determinant of the 2x2 matrix \(\mathbf{R}\), we start with its given form:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \mathbf{R} = \begin{pmatrix} r_{11} & r_{12} \\ r_{21} & r_{22} \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m where \(r_{11}, r_{12}, r_{21},\) and \(r_{22}\) are the elements of the matrix. The determinant of a 2x2 matrix \(\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix}\) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{det} = ad - bc
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m For our matrix \(\mathbf{R}\):
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m r_{11} = r_{12} = r_{21} = r_{22} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m with equal sides \(r_{11} = r_{12} = r_{21} = r_{22} = r\).
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Substituting these values into the determinant formula:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{det} = (1)(1) - (1)(1)
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{det} = 1 - 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \text{det} = 0
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m Thus, the determinant of the matrix \(\mathbf{R}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \boxed{0}
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 1
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=251513)[0m 
